  "releaseNotes": "feat(dmg): hoist .VolumeIcon.icns and .background; keep top-level files at root when scaffolding; update docs (#85)\\n\\n* CLI: add dmg from-project (experimental) publishing and bundling to .dmg with minimal .app scaffolding if needed\\n\\n* feat(dmg): hoist .VolumeIcon.icns and .background to image root; keep top-level files at root when scaffolding .app; update WARP.md docs\\n\\n* fix(dmg): require --rid for dmg from-project to avoid host RID inference producing non-mac binaries; update docs\\n\\n* fix(cli): require --rid on non-target hosts for rpm/deb/appimage/msix from-project to avoid incorrect host RID inference; update docs\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: DotnetPackaging Bot <bot@dotnetpackaging.local>",
